B.a1j=s(["\xd6ncelikli olarak temel ia\u015fe (bu\u011fday, arpa) ve hammadde (odun, ta\u015f) karolar\u0131n\u0131 onar\u0131n.","\u015eatonuz hasar alm\u0131\u015fsa bir sonraki ak\u0131n\u0131 ba\u015flatmadan \xf6nce mutlaka Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 onar\u0131n."],t.s)
