B.Td=new A.by("defense_perimeter_walls",B.js,"Hex \xc7evre Surlar\u0131 & Tahkimat","Perimeter Walls & Fortifications","Hexin 6 kenar\u0131na \xf6r\xfclen ak\u0131ll\u0131 \xe7evre surlar\u0131. D\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n ilerlemesini durdurur ve y\u0131k\u0131lana kadar yolu kapat\u0131r.","Smart perimeter walls guarding all 6 hex edges. Blocks enemy advances completely until breached.","Surlar 3 kademeden olu\u015fur: Ah\u015fap \xc7it (120 HP), Ta\u015f Sur (300 HP) ve Demir Tahkimat (750 HP). Ak\u0131ll\u0131 \xe7evre motoru sayesinde iki kom\u015fu karoda da sur varsa aralar\u0131ndaki i\xe7 kenar duvar\u0131 otomatik kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r ve kusursuz bir d\u0131\u015f kale suru olu\u015fturulur. D\xfc\u015fmanlar sur olan karoya geldiklerinde i\xe7eri giremezler; durup suru y\u0131kmaya \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rlar ve surun dikenlerinden pasif kar\u015f\u0131 hasar al\u0131rlar. Surlar y\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda (isBreached) yol a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Hasar g\xf6ren surlar k\u0131smi maliyetle kolayca onar\u0131labilir.","Walls feature 3 tiers: Wooden Palisade (120 HP), Stone Rampart (300 HP), and Iron Fortification (750 HP). Smart edge rendering hides interior walls between adjacent fortified hexes, forming a unified outer battlement. Enemies cannot enter walled hexes until the wall is breached, taking passive thorn damage while attacking.",B.Up,B.F,"SUR / TAHK\u0130MAT",B.a3W,B.a1C,B.a_N,B.Za,B.a1Q,B.Zs)
