B.Xw=s(["Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Seviye 5 veya \xfczerine y\xfckseltin.","Fethedilmi\u015f bo\u015f bir karoya dokunup \u0130N\u015eA ET men\xfcs\xfcnden SAVUNMA KULES\u0130 se\xe7in.","Kuleleri d\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f koridorlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7apraz ate\u015fe alacak \u015fekilde konu\u015fland\u0131r\u0131n.","Kuleyi y\xfckselterek at\u0131\u015f hasar\u0131n\u0131 ve menzil g\xfcc\xfcn\xfc art\u0131r\u0131n."],t.s)
B.a1e=s(["Upgrade the Khan Tent to Level 5 or higher.","Tap any owned empty hex and select WATCHTOWER from the build sheet.","Position towers at tactical choke points to create deadly crossfire zones.","Upgrade towers to boost arrow damage and attack cadence."],t.s)
B.Zv=s(["Sur ile kuleyi ayn\u0131 savunma hatt\u0131nda birle\u015ftirin; d\xfc\u015fman suru k\u0131rmaya \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken kule onlar\u0131 yok eder.","Kuleler gece ak\u0131nlar\u0131nda ayd\u0131nlatma me\u015falesi yayarak sava\u015f atmosferini canland\u0131r\u0131r."],t.s)
B.Yh=s(["Combine walls with watchtowers; enemies stopped by walls will be eliminated under heavy arrow fire.","Watchtowers project atmospheric night torches during raids."],t.s)
